#: src/scenes/login.rb:345
msgctxt "Login"
msgid ""
"Do you want to encrypt this key with a custom PIN? You will be prompted for "
"this PIN every time you start Elten to unlock your account. It will not be "
"saved on the server and will apply only to the auto-login key stored on this "
"device."
